   "line": 5,
   "text": "Now take the wheel, and after every ninety degree turn, shrink the dot to point nine. It spirals in. Its shadow, the left-right position, swings up, nothing, down, nothing, smaller each time. The turn sets the pitch. The shrink sets how fast it dies. That spiral is a pole, in time.",
