   "line": 8,
   "text": "Why that number? The notch is a click minus a ring. In tones, a click is a flat line. The ring is a narrow peak at two thousand hertz. Take it away, and you've bitten two thousand hertz out. [surprise-oh] The ring is how the notch works. A narrow bite needs a narrow peak, and a narrow peak needs a long ring.",
